<p>Austrian prosecutors have filed terrorism-related and other charges against an unnamed 21-year-old accused of planning an Islamist militant attack on Taylor Swift’s Eras Tour concerts in Vienna in August 2024. Authorities arrested the suspect shortly before the scheduled shows; officials later cancelled all three Vienna dates after warning of the alleged plot.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/DqWwVotCHa3Rzm4P9XFTAtC1AbYp3SuJOsUgp9hUGjpcgsBvswLJ2zPKaJ5lOeYwKVcj6V36JT7KMz17bVs9jviykPeBzhMenGZlVrKIu9U3PkinqpHtVmaFsE8cbuIGv-LusfY_Qk2qEcBDAlNjzthm9LJT64ia-eQWDFtKXvj4gjvRiM_d_u3eQpraUMDbuFgu73BxEvZwmy6j7MGgCOd2XvwbNsj1r0s6CxmSR6gOOIGPTQhqv8S0ky9fAONCP96s1Po4wPPxzbFAjw' alt='FILE - Austrian police officers watch Swifties gathering in the city centre in Vienna on Aug. 8, 2024.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Alleged target and method: Prosecutors allege the suspect planned to bomb one of Swift’s Vienna Eras Tour shows.</li><li>Explosives allegation: Prosecutors say the suspect made a small quantity of triacetone triperoxide (TATP), a homemade explosive used in past terror plots.</li><li>Weapons allegation: Prosecutors also accuse the defendant of trying to buy weapons illegally as part of the alleged preparations.</li><li>Islamic State link: Some outlets report prosecutors said the suspect declared allegiance to the Islamic State group (or described him as an ISIS member).</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Vienna prosecutors’ office: The Vienna prosecutors’ office said it will pursue the case in Wiener Neustadt, near Vienna, after filing terrorism-related and other charges against the unnamed 21-year-old suspect. (<a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/europe/article/3343770/austria-files-terror-charges-against-suspect-over-planned-2024-taylor-swift-attack'>South China Morning Post</a>)</li><li>Austrian authorities (2024 security response): Authorities warned of the alleged plot ahead of the August 2024 concerts, prompting the cancellation of all three Vienna dates as a precaution. (<a href='https://www.theguardian.com/music/2026/feb/17/taylor-swift-austria-vienna-concert-terrorism-attack-plot'>The Guardian</a>)</li><li>Prosecution reporting on motive: Prosecutors said the suspect declared allegiance to the Islamic State group, casting the allegations as ideologically motivated rather than an ordinary criminal case. (<a href='https://www.theglobeandmail.com/world/article-taylor-swift-terrorist-attack-vienna-austria/'>The Globe and Mail</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/europe/article/3343770/austria-files-terror-charges-against-suspect-over-planned-2024-taylor-swift-attack'>Austria files terror charges against suspect over planned 2024 Taylor Swift attack</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/music/2026/feb/17/taylor-swift-austria-vienna-concert-terrorism-attack-plot'>Taylor Swift concert attack plot: 21-year-old man charged with terrorism in Austria</a> - theguardian.com</li><li><a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/news/taylor-swift-concert-attack-plot-leads-to-terrorism-charges-against-21-year-old-man/'>21-year-old man facing terrorism charges in Taylor Swift concert attack plot</a> - cbsnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dw.com/en/austria-files-terror-charges-in-alleged-taylor-swift-concert-plot/a-75995128'>Austria files terror charges in alleged Taylor Swift concert plot</a> - dw.com</li><li><a href='https://abcnews.go.com/International/wireStory/austrian-prosecutors-file-terrorism-charges-suspect-plot-attack-130210462'>Terrorism charges filed against suspect over plot to attack Taylor Swift show</a> - abcnews.go.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/europe/austria-files-charges-against-suspect-over-planned-2024-taylor-swift-attack'>Austria files charges against suspect over planned 2024 Taylor Swift attack</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theglobeandmail.com/world/article-taylor-swift-terrorist-attack-vienn